  "text": "The question is followed by two statements I and II.\n Mark\n A. if the question can be answered by any one of the statements alone, but cannot be answered by using the other statement\n   alone.\n B. if the question can be answered by using either statement alone.\n C. if the question can be answered by using both the statements together, but cannot be answered by using either statement\n   alone.\n D. if the question cannot be answered even by using both the statements together.\n How many students among A, B, C and D have passed the examination?\n  I. The following is a true statement: A and B passed the examination.\n II. The following is a false statement: At least one among C and D has passed the examination.",
